{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xhkmqh","slideIndex":1,"text":"主题提案，故事与视觉均为原创设计建议，尚未确定为最终游戏设定。\n图片为内置 image_gen 生成的概念图，不是游戏截图，也不是可直接导入的模型或材质。\n生成提示词：Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: material and modeling reference board for game art. Cohesive wide 16:9 studio tabletop composition on charcoal-violet neutral background showing a memory-consuming Gothic castle asset family: a stone pointed arch and ribbed pillar behind, cracked ornate portrait frame with an erased face, candleholder and candelabrum, torn burgundy velvet drapery, a faceless court knight with an elegant antique carbine, a small cracked memory crystal and brass locket. Natural material sample chunks of worn limestone, embossed gold metal, black crystal and red velvet placed among the props. Objects separated and legible, original designs, painterly game concept art, soft candle amber key light and pale lavender accents, no gore. No words, annotations, cards, labels, UI, logos or watermark. Concept reference only.\n\n素材搜集要求：优先可拼接建筑模块，检查底部枢轴、统一厘米尺度、UV、简单碰撞与可步行面。角色需要骨骼、基础待机/移动/受击动画，武器需要独立可拆部件。PBR贴图至少包括Base Color、Normal、Roughness、AO，金属件另需Metallic，能源或灯具另需Emissive遮罩。建议首版采用2K可平铺材质及独立贴花。按项目使用范围核对授权和来源，保持同一写实或风格化程度。关键词用于检索素材类型，不指向已验证的具体商品。\n\nP1 氛围扩展：漂浮字迹、画像褪色、晶体微光。首版用静态贴图讲故事。\n配色：炭黑 #211D28, 旧石灰岩 #A99D88, 暗红绒布 #6F263C, 记忆紫光 #A89BD4\n核心材质：石灰岩、暗红绒布、旧金属。紫光只用于记忆与超自然线索。"}